@startuml forgotten_cantrips_spectral_bed_sequence
title Forgotten Cantrips - Spectral Bed Cantrip Sequence

skinparam shadowing false

actor "Player" as Player
participant "Minecraft Client" as Client
participant "Forge / Minecraft Server" as Server
participant "Mana and Artifice\nCantrip Registry" as MNA
participant "Forgotten Cantrips\nCantripRegistry" as FCRegistry
queue "Mana and Artifice\nDelayedEventQueue" as Queue
participant "SpectralBedCantripLogic" as Logic
database "Minecraft Level\nworld state" as Level
participant "SpectralBedBlock" as BedBlock

Player -> Client : Cast spectral bed cantrip
Client -> Server : Send cast interaction
Server -> MNA : Resolve cantrip pattern
MNA -> FCRegistry : Invoke registered callback
FCRegistry -> Queue : Schedule delayed execution

... icon delay elapses ...

Queue -> Logic : run(player, cantrip, hand)
Logic -> Level : Raycast and validate placement

alt Invalid target, time, or space
  Logic -> Server : Send translatable feedback
  Server -> Client : Display message
else Valid placement
  Logic -> Level : Place spectral bed states
  Logic -> Level : Attach block entity
  Level -> Client : Sync world update
end

Player -> Client : Use spectral bed
Client -> Server : Send block-use interaction
Server -> BedBlock : Validate sleep rules
BedBlock -> Server : Start sleep without spawnpoint
Server -> Client : Sync sleep state or message
@enduml
